sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Mail client
    participant D as Director
    participant P as IMAP session
    participant A as Authenticator
    participant S as Store
    C->>D: TLS + login
    D->>P: backend connection + PROXY client IP
    P->>P: session_id / connection_open
    D->>P: backend authentication
    P->>A: request with mechanism and connection context
    alt backend temporarily unavailable
        A-->>P: ErrTemporary
        P-->>D: NO UNAVAILABLE
    else access denied
        A-->>P: error
        P->>P: auth_failed
        P-->>D: NO AUTHENTICATIONFAILED
    else authentication succeeded
        A-->>P: Result.Account + Attributes
        P->>P: check account connection limit
        P->>S: User(canonical account)
        S-->>P: model.User
        P->>P: apply provisioning / quota
        P->>P: auth_success
        P-->>D: OK
        D-->>C: logged in
    end
    C->>D: logout
    D->>P: logout / close connection
    P->>P: release resources / connection_close
